  "text": "New sign-in to your Geet account\n\nSomeone signed in to your Geet account from a device we haven't seen before.\n\nDevice: {{device}}\nLocation: {{location}} (approximate)\nTime: {{time}}\nSigned in with: {{method}}\n\nIf this was you, there's nothing to do.\n\nIf it wasn't, sign out of every device now:\n{{secure_url}}\n\nThen check how you sign in (Google or email) is still safe.\n\nGeet will never ask for a sign-in code by email, message or phone call.\nSecurity email for {{email}}. You can't turn these off.\n\nGeet - Music sounds better together.\n"
